      "hindiTransliteration": "जा चर कहि कर नाथ सबद को ठानीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108659",
      "sourceShabadId": "9574",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0776_line_0026",
      "lineIndex": 26,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਸਬਦ ਕੋ ਤਾ ਕੇ ਅੰਤਿ ਭਨੀਜੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "satr sabadh ko taa ke a(n)t bhaneejeeaai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਮਗਰੋਂ) ਉਸ ਦੇ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 776,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सत्रु सबद को ता के अंति भनीजीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108660",
      "sourceShabadId": "9574",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0776_line_0027",
      "lineIndex": 27,
      "gurmukhi": "ਹੋ ਸਕਲ ਤੁਪਕ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਚਹੋ ਤਹ ਦੀਜੀਐ ॥੯੭੫॥",
      "transliteration": "ho sakal tupak ke naam chaho teh dheejeeaai ||975||",
      "translation": "Say the word “Bhag” after “Rainraavani”, then speak the words “Jaachar-naath-shatru” and make the desired use of the names of Tupak.975.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਸਭ ਜਿਥੇ ਚਾਹੋ, ਤੁਪਕ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਵਜੋਂ ਦਿਓ ॥੯੭੫॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 776,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "हो सकल तुपक के नाम चहो तह दीजीऐ ॥९७५॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108661",
      "sourceShabadId": "9574",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0776_line_0028",
      "lineIndex": 28,
      "gurmukhi": "ਰੈਨ ਰਾਜ ਕਹਿ ਭਗਾ ਬਖਾਨਨ ਕੀਜੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "rain raaj keh bhagaa bakhaanan keejeeaai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਰੈਨ ਰਾਜ' ਕਹਿ ਕੇ (ਫਿਰ) 'ਭਗਾ' (ਸ਼ਬਦ) ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 776,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "रैन राज कहि भगा बखानन कीजीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108662",
      "sourceShabadId": "9574",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0776_line_0029",
      "lineIndex": 29,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਾ ਚਰ ਕਹਿ ਕਰਿ ਨਾਥ ਸਬਦ ਕੋ ਦੀਜੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jaa char keh kar naath sabadh ko dheejeeaai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਫਿਰ) 'ਜਾ ਚਰ ਨਾਥ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 776,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जा चर कहि करि नाथ सबद को दीजीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108663",
      "sourceShabadId": "9574",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0776_line_0030",
      "lineIndex": 30,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਸਬਦ ਕੋ ਤਾ ਕੇ ਅੰਤਿ ਉਚਾਰੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "satr sabadh ko taa ke a(n)t uchaareeaai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਸ ਦੇ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਨੂੰ ਉਚਾਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 776,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सत्रु सबद को ता के अंति उचारीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108664",
      "sourceShabadId": "9574",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0776_line_0031",
      "lineIndex": 31,
      "gurmukhi": "ਹੋ ਸਕਲ ਤੁਪਕ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਸੁਬੁਧਿ ਮਨ ਧਾਰੀਐ ॥੯੭੬॥",
      "transliteration": "ho sakal tupak ke naam subudh man dhaareeaai ||976||",
      "translation": "Saying the word “Rainraaj”, speak the word “Bhagaa”, then add the words “Jaachar-naath-shatru” and in this way, know all the names of Tupak.976.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਸਾਰੇ ਬੁੱਧੀਮਾਨ ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਤੁਪਕ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੯੭੬॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 776,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "हो सकल तुपक के नाम सुबुधि मन धारीऐ ॥९७६॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108665",
      "sourceShabadId": "9574",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0776_line_0032",
      "lineIndex": 32,
      "gurmukhi": "ਚੌਪਈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "chauapiee ||",
      "translation": "CHAUPAI",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਚੌਪਈ:",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 776,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "चौपई ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108666",
      "sourceShabadId": "9575",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0776_line_0033",
      "lineIndex": 33,
      "gurmukhi": "ਰੈਨ ਰਾਵ ਕਹਿ ਭਗਾ ਬਖਾਨੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "rain raav keh bhagaa bakhaano ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਪਹਿਲਾ) 'ਰੈਨ ਰਾਵ ਭਗਾ' ਬਖਾਨ ਕਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 776,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "रैन राव कहि भगा बखानो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108667",
      "sourceShabadId": "9575",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0776_line_0034",
      "lineIndex": 34,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਾ ਚਰ ਕਹਿ ਪਤਿ ਸਬਦ ਪ੍ਰਮਾਨੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jaa char keh pat sabadh pramaano ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਫਿਰ) 'ਜਾ ਚਰ ਪਤਿ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਨੂੰ ਜੋੜੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 776,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जा चर कहि पति सबद प्रमानो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108668",
      "sourceShabadId": "9575",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0776_line_0035",
      "lineIndex": 35,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਸਬਦ ਤਿਹ ਅੰਤਿ ਭਣਿਜੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "satr sabadh teh a(n)t bhanijai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਫਿਰ) ਉਸ ਦੇ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 776,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सत्रु सबद तिह अंति भणिजै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108669",
      "sourceShabadId": "9575",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0776_line_0036",
      "lineIndex": 36,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਾਮ ਤੁਪਕ ਜਹ ਚਹੋ ਕਹਿਜੈ ॥੯੭੭॥",
      "transliteration": "naam tupak jeh chaho kahijai ||977||",
      "translation": "After saying “rainraav”, utter the words “Bhagaa-jaachar-pati-shatru” and say the names of Tupak.977.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਜਿਥੇ ਚਾਹੋ, ਤੁਪਕ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਵਜੋਂ ਕਹੋ ॥੯੭੭॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 776,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नाम तुपक जह चहो कहिजै ॥९७७॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108670",
      "sourceShabadId": "9575",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0776_line_0037",
      "lineIndex": 37,
      "gurmukhi": "ਦਿਨ ਅਰਿ ਕਹਿ ਭਗ ਸਬਦ ਬਖਾਨੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "dhin ar keh bhag sabadh bakhaano ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਪਹਿਲਾ) 'ਦਿਨ ਅਰਿ ਭਗ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 776,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "दिन अरि कहि भग सबद बखानो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108671",
      "sourceShabadId": "9575",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0776_line_0038",
      "lineIndex": 38,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਾ ਚਰ ਕਹਿ ਨਾਇਕ ਪਦ ਠਾਨੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jaa char keh naik padh Thaano ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਫਿਰ) 'ਜਾ ਚਰ ਨਾਇਕ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 776,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जा चर कहि नाइक पद ठानो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108672",
      "sourceShabadId": "9575",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0776_line_0039",
      "lineIndex": 39,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਸਬਦ ਤਿਹ ਅੰਤਿ ਸੁ ਕਹੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "satr sabadh teh a(n)t su kaheeaai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਸ ਦੇ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 776,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सत्रु सबद तिह अंति सु कहीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108673",
      "sourceShabadId": "9575",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0776_line_0040",
      "lineIndex": 40,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਾਮ ਤੁਪਕ ਉਚਰਹੁ ਜਹ ਚਹੀਐ ॥੯੭੮॥",
      "transliteration": "naam tupak ucharahu jeh chaheeaai ||978||",
      "translation": "Saying the word “Din-ari-bhag”, utter the words “Jaachar nayak-shatru” then speak the names of Tupak.978.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਜਿਥੇ ਚਾਹੋ, ਤੁਪਕ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਕਰ ਕੇ ਉਚਰੋ ॥੯੭੮॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 776,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नाम तुपक उचरहु जह चहीऐ ॥९७८॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108674",
      "sourceShabadId": "9575",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0776_line_0041",
      "lineIndex": 41,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤਮਚਰ ਕਹਿ ਭਗ ਸਬਦ ਬਖਾਨੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "tamachar keh bhag sabadh bakhaano ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਤਮਚਰ ਭਗ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 776,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "तमचर कहि भग सबद बखानो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108675",
      "sourceShabadId": "9575",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0776_line_0042",
      "lineIndex": 42,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਾ ਚਰ ਕਹਿ ਨਾਇਕ ਪਦ ਠਾਨੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jaa char keh naik padh Thaano ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਫਿਰ) 'ਜਾ ਚਰ ਨਾਇਕ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 776,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जा चर कहि नाइक पद ठानो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108676",
      "sourceShabadId": "9575",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0776_line_0043",
      "lineIndex": 43,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਸਬਦ ਕੋ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਭਣਿਜੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "satr sabadh ko bahur bhanijai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਮਗਰੋਂ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਨੂੰ ਉਚਾਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 776,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सत्रु सबद को बहुरि भणिजै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108677",
      "sourceShabadId": "9575",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0776_line_0044",
      "lineIndex": 44,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਾਮ ਤੁਪਕ ਕੇ ਸਭ ਲਹਿ ਲਿਜੈ ॥੯੭੯॥",
      "transliteration": "naam tupak ke sabh leh lijai ||979||",
      "translation": "Saying “Tamchar-nayak-shatru” and know all the names of Tupak.979.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਸਭ ਤੁਪਕ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੯੭੯॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 776,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नाम तुपक के सभ लहि लिजै ॥९७९॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108678",
      "sourceShabadId": "9575",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0776_line_0045",
      "lineIndex": 45,
      "gurmukhi": "ਰੈਣ ਰਾਵਿ ਕਹਿ ਭਗਣਿ ਕਹੀਜੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "rain raav keh bhagan kaheejai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਰੈਣ ਰਾਵਿ ਭਗਣਿ' ਕਹੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 776,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "रैण रावि कहि भगणि कहीजै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108679",
      "sourceShabadId": "9575",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0776_line_0046",
      "lineIndex": 46,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਾ ਚਰ ਕਹਿ ਨਾਇਕ ਪਦ ਦੀਜੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jaa char keh naik padh dheejai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਫਿਰ) 'ਜਾ ਚਰ ਨਾਇਕ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 776,
