      "hindiTransliteration": "जा चर कहि नाइक पद दीजै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108680",
      "sourceShabadId": "9575",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0776_line_0047",
      "lineIndex": 47,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਸਬਦ ਕੋ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਉਚਾਰਹੁ ॥",
      "transliteration": "satr sabadh ko bahur uchaarahu ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਮਗਰੋਂ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਉਚਾਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 776,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सत्रु सबद को बहुरि उचारहु ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "108681",
      "sourceShabadId": "9575",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0776_line_0048",
      "lineIndex": 48,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਕਲ ਤੁਪਕ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਬਿਚਾਰਹੁ ॥੯੮੦॥",
      "transliteration": "sakal tupak ke naam bichaarahu ||980||",
      "translation": "Saying “Rainraav”, utter the word “Bhagini”, then add the words “Jaachar-nayak-shatru” and in this way consider all the names of Tupak.980.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਸਾਰੇ ਤੁਪਕ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੯੮੦॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 776,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सकल तुपक के नाम बिचारहु ॥९८०॥",
